+/**
+ * Netie Control stage 2, orchestration family: a refused worker start, federated attach,
+ * automation run or external cron action never reaches a process, session or dispatch row, and the
+ * label reaches the caller. The renderer Run Now / Rerun toast case lives in
+ * src/renderer/src/lib/netie-automation-run-actions.test.ts. Each case drives the real chokepoint with the upstream harness of that
+ * chokepoint, starting from the shipped default (flag unset).
+ */
+
